Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.64,0:20:38.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.48,0:20:41.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想你需要帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I figured you might like some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.68,0:20:50.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个要放哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where does this go?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.32,0:20:55.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毛衣放在衣橱里吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um.... Do your sweaters go in the closet?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.24,0:21:10.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.84,0:21:13.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道  看起来像是日记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. Looks like a diary to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.68,0:21:20.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来看一下吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.28,0:21:23.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"南茜汤普森  榆树街1428号"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Nancy Thompson. 1428 Elm Street."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.36,0:21:25.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.16,0:21:29.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道吗  这是五年前的日记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you know, this thing is five years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.00,0:21:33.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你认识她吗  - 不认识  那时我还没有搬过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know her? - Uh-uh. No. Before my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.84,0:21:37.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下  你听这一段\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, listen to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.76,0:21:39.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"有时我躺在床上  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Sometimes when I'm lying here in bed...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.80,0:21:44.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以看到对面的葛兰在房间  准备要上床睡觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I can see Glen in his window across the way getting ready for bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.88,0:21:46.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的身材健壮光滑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His body is slim and smooth...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.68,0:21:50.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道我不该看他  但我的心是渴望他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and I know I shouldn't watch him but that part of me that wants him...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.12,0:21:53.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我盯着他看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...forces me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.64,0:21:54.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那时的我如此软弱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's when I wea.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.04,0:21:56.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那时我想去找他"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's when I wanna go to him."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.92,0:22:01.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我能看一下吗 - 嗯嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can I see that? - Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.56,0:22:06.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"3月15日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"March 15th.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.00,0:22:08.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚上他来找我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He comes to me at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.72,0:22:12.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可怕  丑陋  肮脏  跟我一起躺在床上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Horrible, ugly, dirty, under the sheets with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.96,0:22:17.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用他的钢爪撕开我的睡衣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tearing at my nightgown with his steel claws.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.76,0:22:22.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他叫做佛莱迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His name is Fred...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.92,0:22:25.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他一直想带我去锅炉室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and he keeps trying to take me to the boiler room.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.04,0:22:28.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想杀了我"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wants to kill me."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.16,0:22:36.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.24,0:22:42.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"提娜死了"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Tina is dead."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.44,0:22:48.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰西  你没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesse, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.92,0:22:52.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葛莱帝跟我提过这件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just something that Grady said to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.76,0:22:56.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以前住在这里的女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About the that used to live here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.28,0:23:00.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她看到住在对面的男朋友被杀  因此发疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How she went crazy when she saw her boyfriend get murdered across the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.20,0:23:19.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.08,0:25:53.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点  杰西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go ahead, Jesse.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.28,0:25:54.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,试试看大小合不合适\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try it on for size.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.40,0:26:06.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮我杀人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.32,0:26:28.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我像是在梦游一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was kind of like I was sleepwalking.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.36,0:26:31.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许你有通灵的超能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you were having a premonition or something, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.24,0:26:34.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像那些帮助警方破案  寻找失踪人口的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like the guys who help police solve crimes and find missing people.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.16,0:26:36.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以前会这样吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ever have anything like this happen before?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.00,0:26:38.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  从来没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nope. Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.52,0:26:41.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你真的认为是那样  - 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You think that's what it is? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.16,0:26:44.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能让我看一下日记吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I see the diary for a little while?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.40,0:26:46.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.68,0:26:48.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 两位好  - 凯丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi, guys. - Hi, Kerry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.12,0:26:51.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我收到你的周末派对邀请函了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got your invitation for the party this weed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.16,0:26:53.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会有帅哥来吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any cute guys gonna be there?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.76,0:26:55.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全都是帅哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of them. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.64,0:26:58.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次也是你爸当流行音乐节目主持人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is your dad gonna be the DJ again?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.72,0:27:01.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 妈这次会把他关在楼上  - 太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mom is gonna keep him upstairs this time. - Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.20,0:27:04.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我上次办派对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last party I had...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.36,0:27:07.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爸坚持整晚要播班尼古德曼的歌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...my Dad insisted on playing Benny Goodman records all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.96,0:27:11.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 待会儿见  好吗  - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, I'll see you later, okay? - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.80,0:27:27.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葛莱帝  你记得你做过的梦吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Grady, do you remember your dreams?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.72,0:27:29.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只记得春梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only the wet ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.40,0:27:31.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.08,0:27:34.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葛莱帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Grady.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.92,0:27:41.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史奈德不该在最后一局把你换下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, Schneider shouldn't have called you out on that last play.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.24,0:27:44.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  今天史奈德是个王八蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, Schneider has got a stick up his ass today.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.88,0:27:46.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史奈德一直都是个王八蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Schneider's always got a stick up his ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.32,0:27:50.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两个浑虫  你们好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, dirtballs.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.60,0:28:17.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这里真的很热  - 对  宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ugh. It is so hot in here. - Yeah, babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.84,0:28:21.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看一下自动调温器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me Iook at the thermostat.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.76,0:28:32.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊  这里热得跟烤箱一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God, it is hot as an oven in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.92,0:28:36.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小鸟在睡觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shh. The birds are sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.12,0:28:40.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪若  这里是摄氏36度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cheryl, it's 97 degrees in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.32,0:29:01.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it. Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.32,0:29:04.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安琪拉  小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Angela, watch out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.52,0:29:07.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心  杰西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out, Jesse.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.64,0:29:10.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 啊  - 肯  你没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ah! - Ken,are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.16,0:29:15.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死的鸟  小心  安琪拉  快闪开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn bird. Look out, Angela, get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.48,0:29:18.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心  杰西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out, Jesse.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.44,0:29:21.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 来吧  - 小心  安琪拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on. - Look out, Angela.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.08,0:29:26.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰西  快让开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesse, get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.76,0:29:28.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪若\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cheryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.24,0:29:54.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在做什么  杰西  帮我把这玩意儿移开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing, Jesse? Help me move this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.76,0:29:57.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这不是瓦斯漏气  - 别跟我说不是瓦斯漏气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It isn't the gas. - Don't tell me it's not the gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.60,0:29:59.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你妈觉得她闻到瓦斯味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mother thought she smelled gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.76,0:30:01.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为我闻到了  我不确定  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I thought I did, I wasn't sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.57,0:30:03.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  怎么了  这是狂鸟病吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, so, what is it, bird rabies?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.56,0:30:06.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 一定是你买的饲料有问题  - 拜托  肯  真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's that seed you've been buying. - Please, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.56,0:30:08.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  有可能  这一定有合理的解释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it could be. Got to be a rational explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.00,0:30:11.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,动物不会没理由突然自爆  对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Animals don't explode into flames for no reason, do they?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.80,0:30:13.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 没错  - 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's right. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.64,0:30:15.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对不是瓦斯漏气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's sure not a leaky gas pipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.56,0:30:19.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧  - 没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You all right? - Oh, it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.00,0:30:22.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你在搞鬼  对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You set this whole thing up, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.24,0:30:25.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在胡说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.68,0:30:28.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道我在说什么  你用了什么  爆竹吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what I'm talking about. What did you use, firecrackers?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.80,0:30:31.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道他做了什么  他用了冲天炮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what he did, he used a goddamn cherry bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.36,0:30:32.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 少来  - 他就是那么做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stop it. - That's what he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.96,0:30:34.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  你不能那样子跟我说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, you can't talk to me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.80,0:30:36.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 杰西  给我回来  - 肯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jesse, come back. - Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.40,0:30:38.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 给我回来  杰西  - 别说了  你真的很荒谬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come back, Jesse! - Stop it, you're being ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.84,0:30:39.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好了  别说了  - 杰西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now come on, stop it. - Jesse!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.48,0:30:54.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.36,0:32:00.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.00,0:32:04.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不知道  他一直想  - 别碰我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't know, he always wants to. - Don't touch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.60,0:32:40.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能给我一杯啤酒吗  谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I have a beer, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.80,0:33:39.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去冲个澡吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hit the shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.84,0:35:52.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不  不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.84,0:36:01.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.88,0:36:04.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, goddamn it, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.32,0:36:11.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.12,0:36:51.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.64,0:36:54.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.68,0:36:56.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.96,0:37:26.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.68,0:37:30.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安  这是你们的儿子吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good evening, uh, does this belong to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.96,0:37:33.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  他是我儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, yes, sir, he's my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.20,0:37:35.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们发现他在公路上游荡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We found him out on the highway wandering around.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.72,0:37:38.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没穿衣服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.84,0:37:40.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我建议你们管好他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd keep a short leash on him if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.16,0:37:42.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你  警官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.40,0:37:44.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰西  进来  快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesse, come here, come.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.12,0:37:47.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.36,0:37:50.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.56,0:37:54.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有两个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.88,0:37:57.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你回答问题  大家都能去睡  好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You answer them and we can all go to bed, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.36,0:38:04.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你吃了什么药  儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you taking, son?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.96,0:38:06.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁给你药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you getting it from?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.00,0:38:11.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有嗑药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not taking drugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.08,0:38:16.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 妈  我要睡了  - 对  来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mom, I wanna go to bed. - Yeah, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.84,0:38:31.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那只是个我得自己解决的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just a problem I have to work out on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.24,0:38:32.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 但有事让你感到困扰  - 妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But something's bothering you. - Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.08,0:38:34.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们只是很担心你  杰西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're just concerned about you, Jesse.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.96,0:38:36.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我没事  别烦我  - 我们  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm fine, just leave me alone. - Can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.64,0:38:40.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们不能谈一谈吗  - 不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can't we at least talk about it? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.80,0:38:55.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他需要专家帮忙  我想我们该送他去看心理医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He needs professional help. I think we have to take him to a psychiatrist.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.40,0:38:58.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少来了  雪若  你疯了  那么做有什么好处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Cheryl, you're out of your gourd. What will that do?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.60,0:39:01.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道  他需要帮助  我们不知道怎么帮他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. He needs help and we don't know how to give it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.60,0:39:03.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别闹了  雪若  - 你听到了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, come on, Cheryl. - Are you hearing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.08,0:39:07.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那孩子有麻烦  - 不  他没有麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That boy's in trouble. - No, he's not in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.76,0:39:10.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那孩子需要被好好管教一顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What that boy needs is a good goddamn kick in the butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.44,0:39:11.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他只需要那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what he needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.88,0:39:16.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道他需要什么  他需要去戒毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll tell you what he needs. He needs a methadone clinic.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.00,0:39:35.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生了什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.72,0:39:39.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有的学生回到教室  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want all you back to your classes....
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.56,0:39:43.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry about what....
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.12,0:39:47.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别担心  让他们做他们的工作  好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just don't worry about it. Let them do their work, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.32,0:39:48.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兄弟  你跑到哪里去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo, man, where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.96,0:39:51.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 昨晚史奈德被杀了  - 天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Schneider got wasted last night. - Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.32,0:39:54.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他一定是在加班  有个疯子把他当香肠开肠剖肚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He must have been working late. Some maniac sliced him like a kielbasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.80,0:39:58.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在洗澡间攻击他  到处都是血脚印\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hacked him in the shower. Got bloody footprints all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.40,0:39:59.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请退到封锁线后面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}COPStand back from the line, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.60,0:40:39.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮我杀人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.76,0:41:04.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一  二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One, two
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.96,0:41:10.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佛莱迪来找你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freddy's coming for you
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.20,0:41:14.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三  四\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three, four
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.36,0:41:19.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你最好锁上门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better lock your door
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.72,0:41:23.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五  六\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five, six
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.64,0:41:28.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿起你的十字架\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grab your crucifix
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.12,0:41:35.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 早安  杰西  - 早安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Morning, Jess. - Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.20,0:41:49.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸  他们为什么花了五年时间  才把房子卖掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, how come it took them five years to sell this house?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.44,0:41:50.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.60,0:41:52.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想是价钱一直无法让他们满意吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They just couldn't get the right price, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.04,0:41:55.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不知道对面发生过命案吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didn't know about the murder across the street?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.36,0:41:57.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住在这里的女孩目睹整个过程  后来发疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The that lived here that saw the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.76,0:41:59.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们跟我提过  可是我… \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They told me something about it, yeah, but I...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.12,0:42:02.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你是说你早就知道这件…  - 拜托  雪若\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You knew something about this... - Come on, Cheryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.56,0:42:05.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得我们怎么会  谈到这么低的价钱  甜心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you think we got such a good deal here, hon?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.20,0:42:09.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们有跟你说那女孩疯了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did they tell you that that lost her mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.28,0:42:11.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她妈妈在客厅自杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And her mother killed herself in our living room?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.76,0:42:13.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么  - 他们有跟你说吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Did they tell you that?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.60,0:42:15.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈  我好害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom, I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.04,0:42:18.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 过来  - 甜心  没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come here. - Oh, honey, it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.52,0:42:20.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸跟杰西只是在闹着玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy and Jesse are just pretending, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.08,0:42:23.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想我们不该在这里讨论这件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think this is something we should discuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.44,0:42:25.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看吧  我不想听这件事  杰西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See? Don't wanna hear one more word about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.72,0:42:28.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的没事  我是说  这间房子没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's absolutely nothing, I mean nothing, wrong with this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.12,0:42:30.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.04,0:42:32.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有东西烧焦了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is something burning?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.64,0:42:37.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.16,0:42:51.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我看过最疯狂的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the craziest damn thing I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.28,0:42:54.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看  雪若\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look here, Cheryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.64,0:42:56.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,插头根本没插上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wasn't even plugged in.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.80,0:43:04.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰西  你不能为史奈德的死自责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesse, you can't blame yourself for what happened to Schneider.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.32,0:43:06.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你梦到不代表你是凶手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And just because you dreamt it doesn't mean you did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.00,0:43:09.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们要去哪里  - 这边左转\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where are we going? - Veer left over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.68,0:43:15.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  我真的觉得这是你的想像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I really think this is all in your mind, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.52,0:43:17.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你应该是接收到灵界讯息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Iike you're picking up some psychic signals.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.72,0:43:45.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇  这是什么地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow, what is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.92,0:43:48.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还记得日记的内容吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you remember in the diary?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.40,0:43:51.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南茜说她发现自己到了锅炉室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When Nancy said she kept finding herself in a boiler room?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.36,0:43:55.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佛莱迪克格在这里工作  这是老发电厂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Fred Krueger worked here. It's an old power plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.68,0:44:00.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 拿去吧  - 这是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Here. - What is all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.68,0:44:04.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我调查了一下我们的朋友  佛莱迪克格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did some reading on our friend, Fred Krueger.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.40,0:44:24.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这里废弃多久了  - 非常久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How long has it been closed down? - A long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.00,0:44:26.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.44,0:44:30.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.04,0:44:33.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佛莱迪克格绑架了二十个孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fred Krueger kidnapped 20 kids...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.24,0:44:36.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将他们带到这里杀害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and brought them here and killed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.88,0:44:48.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你有感觉了吗  - 你是什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you feel anything? - What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.24,0:44:52.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道  我想你应该会有感应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. I thought you might be able to make a connection or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.84,0:45:04.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我觉得自己是个混蛋  - 专心点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I feel like a jerk. - Shh. Just concentrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.84,0:45:15.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有感觉吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you feel anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.48,0:45:17.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.68,0:46:46.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,醒一醒  小女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wake up, little .
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.72,0:46:52.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,几点了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What time is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.36,0:47:02.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很晚了  继续睡吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's late, go back to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.96,0:47:32.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早安  甜心  你睡得好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morning, honey. Did you sleep okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.28,0:47:34.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.28,0:47:37.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好  你的气色好多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. You're looking better.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.04,0:47:50.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你又做恶梦了  对不对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You had another nightmare, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.76,0:47:52.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  昨晚我很不好受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I had a bad night.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.88,0:47:55.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要谈一谈吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you wanna talk about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.64,0:47:58.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爸以为我嗑药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My dad thinks I'm on drugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.88,0:48:00.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我妈以为我疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My mom thinks I'm crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.60,0:48:03.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我不知道是否该同意她的看法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you know, at this point, I don't know if I don't agree with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.40,0:48:10.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰西是怎么了  他一副阴阳怪气的模样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, what's wrong with Jesse? He seems kind of freaked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.96,0:48:17.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要一起去看电影或去玩吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, wanna go to a movie or something, hang out?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.48,0:48:20.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许可以忘了这些事  大家一起去吃披萨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe get these things off your mind. Get a pizza or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.44,0:48:22.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.00,0:48:25.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朗尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, Ronnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.92,0:48:29.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 明晚你要去莉莎家吗  - 没办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You going to Lisa's house tomorrow night? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.32,0:48:32.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不行  我被禁足了  - 怎么会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can't, I'm grounded. - How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.36,0:48:35.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把我奶奶推下楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I threw my grandmother down a flight of stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.16,0:48:37.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesse.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.08,0:48:39.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰西  我想你该吃点东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesse, I think you should eat something.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.08,0:48:42.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不饿  - 我希望你能跟我谈一谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm not hungry. - I wish you would talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.16,0:48:46.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以一起想办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, we can figure it out. We can figure it out together.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.68,0:48:48.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么可想的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is nothing to figure out.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.36,0:48:51.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道你干嘛  跟这家伙浪费时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know why you're wasting your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.36,0:48:54.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他是个变态  - 闭嘴  葛莱帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's a basket case. - Shut up, Grady.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.64,0:49:00.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要我闭嘴  好  我闭嘴  没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Want me to shut up? Fine, I'll shut up, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.44,0:49:02.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,待会儿不见  兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you around, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.72,0:49:19.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.64,0:49:37.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好啊  - 漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.12,0:49:39.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  别闹了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, now cut that out.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.00,0:49:42.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来处理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.48,0:49:46.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甜心  这派对很好玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, sweetheart, it's a nice party.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.92,0:49:49.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  健美先生  该睡了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Skinny, it's time for bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.44,0:49:53.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交给你了  小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're in charge, hotshot.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.28,0:49:58.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小姐  12点半结束  别拖延\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twelve-thirty, miss, no later.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.92,0:50:01.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 12点半  - 好好玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Twelve-thirty. - Have a nice time.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.60,0:50:10.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.96,0:50:13.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰西是怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter with Jesse?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.36,0:50:15.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.88,0:50:24.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 杰西  - 我马上出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jesse? - I'll be out in a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.16,0:50:27.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能进去跟你谈吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I please come in and talk to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.88,0:50:45.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想离开了  我玩不起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I'm gonna leave. I'm not into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.32,0:50:48.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.28,0:50:51.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰西  你为什么不跟我谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesse, why won't you talk to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.72,0:50:56.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你能不能别来烦我  - 你太不公平了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Will you just leave me alone? - You're not being fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.44,0:50:59.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想帮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.08,0:51:02.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要怎么帮我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.92,0:51:04.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能为我做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you gonna do for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.84,0:51:08.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的  我觉得我快疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I feel like I'm losing my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.12,0:51:12.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不要你看到我崩溃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I don't want you to watch me fall apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.48,0:51:16.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我害怕睡着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid to go to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.28,0:51:17.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,醒着的时候也害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid to stay awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.32,0:51:20.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我毁了你的派对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm ruining your party.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.72,0:51:23.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他们会将我送走  - 好了  别那么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They're gonna take me away. - Come on, don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.00,0:51:26.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  有必要的话  我们整晚都不睡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, we'll stay up all night if we have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.24,0:51:29.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会让你出事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not gonna let anything happen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.92,0:52:08.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  准备好就可以了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, any second now, any second.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.20,0:52:23.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了  派对时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, party time.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.48,0:52:27.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来放音乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.16,0:52:42.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想告诉你我的感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna tell you exactly how I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.56,0:52:47.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他们在搞什么  - 艾迪  他们只是孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What the hell are they doing down there? - Oh, Eddie, they're kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.68,0:52:50.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道他们只是孩子  我得休息一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know they're kids. I gotta get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.08,0:52:56.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在你要离开  是我承认的时候了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now that you're leaving. It's time that I confess.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.08,0:53:01.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,计划我们相爱的方式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The way we planned our love together.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.00,0:53:04.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有时做多与做少一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes doing more is less.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.04,0:53:12.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从耳语变作尖叫  现在我知道这意味着什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From a whisper to a scream. Now I know just what it means.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.44,0:53:18.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从耳语变作尖叫声  我说过我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From a whisper to a scream. I said I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.60,0:53:26.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从耳语变作尖叫  现在我知道这意味着什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From a whisper to a scream. Now I know just what it means.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.32,0:53:41.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天你还只属于我  今天你爱上新欢  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yesterday you were only mine. Today you're loving somebody new.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.12,0:53:45.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.52,0:53:49.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰西  怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesse, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.64,0:54:09.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊  你差点没吓死我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus Christ, you scared the shit out of me, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.72,0:54:12.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.60,0:54:18.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  你跑到我的房间做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, what the fuck are you doing in my room?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.20,0:54:22.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  我惹上大麻烦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I'm in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.76,0:54:24.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚我需要你收容我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you to let me stay here tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.76,0:54:26.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你疯了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you out of your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.24,0:54:28.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.96,0:54:31.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.20,0:54:38.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你何不回家吃瓶安眠药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you just go home and take a bottle of sleeping pills?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.44,0:54:42.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我杀了史奈德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I killed Schneider.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.88,0:54:44.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You what?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.64,0:54:46.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但动手的人不是我  懂吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only it wasn't me, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.04,0:54:48.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我心里的那股力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something inside of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.04,0:54:51.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨晚它要我进我妹的房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And last night it made me go to my sister's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.84,0:54:55.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚我跟莉莎在泳池小屋  我又感觉到那股力量了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And tonight with Lisa in the cabana it started to happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.12,0:54:58.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得你真的疯了  兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you are seriously losing it, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.96,0:55:01.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很害怕  葛莱帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm scared, Grady.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.68,0:55:04.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有股力量想侵入我的身体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something is trying to get inside my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.08,0:55:07.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  她是女生  她在泳池小屋等你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, she's female, she's waiting for you in the cabana.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.48,0:55:08.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你却要跟我睡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you wanna sleep with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.88,0:55:12.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  我不在乎你相不相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I don't care if you believe me or not.
